# Kiora, the Rising Tide: "Threshold — Whenever Kiora attacks, if there are seven or more cards in your graveyard, you may
# create Scion of the Deep, a legendary 8/8 blue Octopus creature token." Exactly seven qualifies. Turn 1: Bot1 Wheels
# off a Black Lotus (graveyard: Lotus, Wheel and three Islands = 5; Bot2's seven discarded cards are not Bot1's).
# Turn 3: Kiora's entry loot discards two more Islands (7). Turn 5: she attacks, Bot1 accepts, and the token appears
# untapped and not attacking while Kiora's three damage lands. Only one is made: nothing but the Black Lotus has left the
# battlefield (a second legendary Scion would have gone by the legend rule, CR 704.5j).

